{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-dom-and-reconciliation","title":"Virtual DOM 与协调算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/rendering-performance/virtual-dom-and-reconciliation","wordCount":936,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"virtual-dom-与协调算法\">Virtual DOM 与协调算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Virtual DOM 用 JavaScript 对象描述真实 DOM，让框架能在内存中比较新旧两棵树，只把最小差异应用到真实 DOM，从而避免昂贵的整页重排。React 的 diff 基于三个启发式策略把 O(n³) 的树比较降到 O(n)：只比较同层级节点、类型不同就整棵替换、用 key 识别同层节点是否可复用。Fiber 架构进一步把渲染拆成可中断的工作单元，配合双缓冲与优先级调度，让高优先级更新（如输入）能插队执行。理解 key 的正确用法（稳定且唯一）是避免无谓重建的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"virtual-dom-的本质\">Virtual DOM 的本质</h2><p>Virtual DOM（虚拟 DOM）是一种编程概念——用 JavaScript 对象来描述真实 DOM 结构。当应用状态发生变化时，框架不会直接操作真实 DOM，而是先在内存中生成新的虚拟 DOM 树，通过 diff 算法与旧树比较，计算出最小的变更集，再一次性应用到真实 DOM 上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[状态变更] --&gt; B[生成新 VDOM 树]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Diff 新旧 VDOM]&#10;    C --&gt; D[生成补丁集]&#10;    D --&gt; E[批量更新真实 DOM]\">graph LR\n    A[状态变更] --&gt; B[生成新 VDOM 树]\n    B --&gt; C[Diff 新旧 VDOM]\n    C --&gt; D[生成补丁集]\n    D --&gt; E[批量更新真实 DOM]</pre><h3 id=\"vdom-节点结构\">VDOM 节点结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VNode {&#10;  type: string | Function;&#10;  props: Record&lt;string, any&gt;;&#10;  children: Array&lt;VNode | string&gt;;&#10;  key: string | number | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const vdom: VNode = {&#10;  type: &#39;div&#39;,&#10;  props: { className: &#39;container&#39; },&#10;  key: null,&#10;  children: [&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;h1&#39;,&#10;      props: { className: &#39;title&#39; },&#10;      key: null,&#10;      children: [&#39;Hello World&#39;],&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;ul&#39;,&#10;      props: { className: &#39;list&#39; },&#10;      key: null,&#10;      children: [&#10;        { type: &#39;li&#39;, props: {}, key: &#39;1&#39;, children: [&#39;Item 1&#39;] },&#10;        { type: &#39;li&#39;, props: {}, key: &#39;2&#39;, children: [&#39;Item 2&#39;] },&#10;        { type: &#39;li&#39;, props: {}, key: &#39;3&#39;, children: [&#39;Item 3&#39;] },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vdom</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'div'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  props: { className: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'container'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  children: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'h1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      props: { className: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      key: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      children: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ul'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      props: { className: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      key: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      children: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'li'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, props: {}, key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, children: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Item 1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'li'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, props: {}, key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, children: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Item 2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'li'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, props: {}, key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, children: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Item 3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"diff-算法原理\">Diff 算法原理</h2><p>完全比较两棵树的时间复杂度是 O(n³)，这对于包含数千个节点的 UI 来说是不可接受的。React 的 Reconciliation 算法通过三个启发式策略将复杂度降低到 O(n)：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Diff 三大策略&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;策略一: 层级比较&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;策略二: 类型比较&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;策略三: Key 标识&quot;]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;只比较同层级节点&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;不跨层级移动&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;类型不同 → 销毁重建&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;类型相同 → 更新属性&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;Key 相同 → 复用节点&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;Key 不同 → 创建新节点&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Diff 三大策略\"] --&gt; B[\"策略一: 层级比较\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"策略二: 类型比较\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"策略三: Key 标识\"]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[\"只比较同层级节点\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"不跨层级移动\"]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[\"类型不同 → 销毁重建\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"类型相同 → 更新属性\"]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[\"Key 相同 → 复用节点\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"Key 不同 → 创建新节点\"]</pre><h3 id=\"策略一-同层级比较\">策略一：同层级比较</h3><p>React 只比较同一层级的节点，不会尝试跨层级匹配。如果一个节点从树的一个位置移到了另一个位置，React 会在旧位置销毁它，在新位置重新创建。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略二-类型比较\">策略二：类型比较</h3><ul>\n<li>类型不同（如 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 变为 <code>&lt;span&gt;</code>）：销毁整个旧子树，创建新子树</li>\n<li>类型相同：保留 DOM 节点，只更新变更的属性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"策略三-key-的作用\">策略三：Key 的作用</h3><p>Key 帮助 React 识别列表中哪些元素被修改、添加或移除。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function TodoList({ items }: { items: Array&lt;{ id: string; text: string }&gt; }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {items.map((item) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={item.id}&gt;{item.text}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function TodoList({ items }: { items: Array&#x3C;{ id: string; text: string }> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {items.map((item) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={item.id}>{item.text}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"key-的错误用法\">Key 的错误用法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function BadList({ items }: { items: string[] }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {items.map((item, index) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={index}&gt;{item}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function BadList({ items }: { items: string[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {items.map((item, index) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;li key={index}>{item}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 index 作为 key 在列表顺序变化时会导致错误的节点复用，产生 UI bug 和不必要的重渲染。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;index 作为 key 的问题&quot;&#10;        A[初始: [A(0), B(1), C(2)]&quot;]&#10;        B[删除 A 后: [B(0), C(1)]&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;React 认为: key=0 从 A 变为 B&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;结果: 不必要的 DOM 更新&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;id 作为 key&quot;&#10;        E[初始: [A(id-a), B(id-b), C(id-c)]&quot;]&#10;        F[删除 A 后: [B(id-b), C(id-c)]&quot;]&#10;        G[&quot;React 认为: key=id-a 被移除&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;结果: 精确的 DOM 操作&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B --&gt; C --&gt; D&#10;    E --&gt; F --&gt; G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"index 作为 key 的问题\"\n        A[初始: [A(0), B(1), C(2)]\"]\n        B[删除 A 后: [B(0), C(1)]\"]\n        C[\"React 认为: key=0 从 A 变为 B\"]\n        D[\"结果: 不必要的 DOM 更新\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"id 作为 key\"\n        E[初始: [A(id-a), B(id-b), C(id-c)]\"]\n        F[删除 A 后: [B(id-b), C(id-c)]\"]\n        G[\"React 认为: key=id-a 被移除\"]\n        H[\"结果: 精确的 DOM 操作\"]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B --&gt; C --&gt; D\n    E --&gt; F --&gt; G --&gt; H</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-fiber-架构\">React Fiber 架构</h2><p>React 16 引入了 Fiber 架构，将渲染工作拆分为可中断的小单元。每个 Fiber 节点代表一个组件实例或 DOM 元素，形成链表结构而非传统的树结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Fiber 树&#10;        ROOT[FiberRoot]&#10;        ROOT --&gt; APP[App Fiber]&#10;        APP --&gt; |child| HEADER[Header Fiber]&#10;        HEADER --&gt; |sibling| MAIN[Main Fiber]&#10;        MAIN --&gt; |sibling| FOOTER[Footer Fiber]&#10;        HEADER --&gt; |child| NAV[Nav Fiber]&#10;        MAIN --&gt; |child| CONTENT[Content Fiber]&#10;        MAIN --&gt; |return| APP&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Fiber 树\n        ROOT[FiberRoot]\n        ROOT --&gt; APP[App Fiber]\n        APP --&gt; |child| HEADER[Header Fiber]\n        HEADER --&gt; |sibling| MAIN[Main Fiber]\n        MAIN --&gt; |sibling| FOOTER[Footer Fiber]\n        HEADER --&gt; |child| NAV[Nav Fiber]\n        MAIN --&gt; |child| CONTENT[Content Fiber]\n        MAIN --&gt; |return| APP\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"双缓冲机制\">双缓冲机制</h3><p>React 维护两棵 Fiber 树——current 树（当前屏幕上显示的）和 workInProgress 树（正在构建的新树）。当 workInProgress 树构建完成后，通过指针切换成为新的 current 树。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Current 树 (屏幕显示)&quot;&#10;        C1[App] --&gt; C2[Header]&#10;        C1 --&gt; C3[Main]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;WorkInProgress 树 (构建中)&quot;&#10;        W1[App&#39;] --&gt; W2[Header&#39;]&#10;        W1 --&gt; W3[&quot;Main&#39; (更新)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    W1 -.-&gt;|alternate| C1&#10;    W3 -.-&gt;|alternate| C3\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Current 树 (屏幕显示)\"\n        C1[App] --&gt; C2[Header]\n        C1 --&gt; C3[Main]\n    end\n    subgraph \"WorkInProgress 树 (构建中)\"\n        W1[App'] --&gt; W2[Header']\n        W1 --&gt; W3[\"Main' (更新)\"]\n    end\n    W1 -.-&gt;|alternate| C1\n    W3 -.-&gt;|alternate| C3</pre><h3 id=\"优先级调度\">优先级调度</h3><p>Fiber 架构的核心优势是支持优先级调度——高优先级的更新（用户输入、动画）可以中断低优先级的更新（数据加载、后台同步）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Immediate</td>\n<td>同步更新</td>\n<td>文本输入、焦点管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UserBlocking</td>\n<td>用户阻塞型</td>\n<td>点击、键盘事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Normal</td>\n<td>普通更新</td>\n<td>数据请求回调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>低优先级</td>\n<td>分析数据、日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Idle</td>\n<td>空闲时处理</td>\n<td>预加载、预计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { startTransition, useDeferredValue } from &quot;react&quot;;&#10;&#10;function SearchPage() {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&quot;&quot;);&#10;  const deferredQuery = useDeferredValue(query);&#10;&#10;  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;) =&gt; {&#10;    setQuery(e.target.value);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={query} onChange={handleChange} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;SearchResults query={deferredQuery} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { startTransition, useDeferredValue } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line