C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleClick}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">同步更新（自动批处理）</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleAsync}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">异步更新（React </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 也批处理）</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Virtual DOM 是 JavaScript 对象描述 UI 结构的抽象层，通过 diff 算法计算最小 DOM 变更。</li>\n<li>React diff 算法通过同层比较、类型比较、Key 标识三大策略将复杂度从 O(n³) 降为 O(n)。</li>\n<li>Key 必须使用稳定唯一标识符，避免使用 index 作为 key。</li>\n<li>Fiber 架构实现了可中断渲染和优先级调度，高优先级更新不会被低优先级更新阻塞。</li>\n<li>React 18 的自动批处理覆盖了所有场景（同步、异步、setTimeout），减少不必要的重渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Virtual DOM 与协调算法","id":"virtual-dom-与协调算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Virtual DOM 的本质","id":"virtual-dom-的本质"},{"level":3,"text":"VDOM 节点结构","id":"vdom-节点结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Diff 算法原理","id":"diff-算法原理"},{"level":3,"text":"策略一：同层级比较","id":"策略一-同层级比较"},{"level":3,"text":"策略二：类型比较","id":"策略二-类型比较"},{"level":3,"text":"策略三：Key 的作用","id":"策略三-key-的作用"},{"level":3,"text":"Key 的错误用法","id":"key-的错误用法"},{"level":2,"text":"React Fiber 架构","id":"react-fiber-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"双缓冲机制","id":"双缓冲机制"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级调度","id":"优先级调度"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染批处理","id":"渲染批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存管理与泄漏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/runtime-performance/memory-management-and-leaks"},"next":{"title":"React 渲染优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/rendering-performance/react-rendering-optimization"}}